[agent:result] 253	### Health Metrics
[agent:result] 254	
[agent:result] 255	| Metric | Description | Use Case |
[agent:result] 256	|--------|-------------|----------|
[agent:result] 257	| `RUN_DURATION_SECONDS` | Total run time | Detect stuck/slow jobs |
[agent:result] 258	| `STREAMING_BACKLOG_BYTES` | Unprocessed data size | Streaming lag |
[agent:result] 259	| `STREAMING_BACKLOG_SECONDS` | Processing delay time | Streaming lag |
[agent:result] 260	| `STREAMING_BACKLOG_FILES` | Unprocessed file count | File processing lag |
[agent:result] 261	| `STREAMING_BACKLOG_RECORDS` | Unprocessed record count | Record processing lag |
